# Delivery plan for separated Compact expression state and utterance history.
project pj001:
  version 9
  title "Separate Compact expression state from utterance history"
  description "Implement Accepted ADR-0025 with separate closed expressionState and utteranceHistory inputs, closed nextUtterance output, content-independent acceptance, and the existing battle revision commit boundary. Under Accepted ADR-0026, allow one fail-closed Compact V2 deep-psyche application repair over a server-defined semantic closure; add no expression retry, recursive repair, lifecycle entity, identifier, receipt, reuse detector, similarity gate, critic, or fallback."
  as_of 2026-09-09
  duration_unit point
  velocity 1p/1d
  finish m011
  target_duration 14p

